RTL8197F / RTL8367 family support v35
=====================================

This image tree supports runtime-selected RTL8367 C/D register families and
retains optional legacy swconfig modules for old B-map chips.

Exact profiles:
  0x6367:0x0020 RTL8367RB-VB (C map)
  0x6367:0x0040 RTL8365MB-VC (C map)
  0x6367:0x00a0 RTL8367S (C map)
  0x6642:0x0030 RTL8367D / RTL8367RB-VC (D map)

Family profiles emit a warning and must be validated on the actual PCB.
RD05 remains the D-map CPU7/EXT1 profile with switch and SoC RX delay tap 6.

Read-only diagnostics:
  rtl8367-family-check
  rd05-v34-check
  rd05-netdiag full
